nown demon slayer in history  being born with the demon slayer mark  transparent world and selfless state as  well as possessing a godlike physique  and innate swordsmanship talent as a  child who has never picked up a sword  before he was able to defeat a trained  sword instructor effortlessly and he was  referred to as a miraculous prodigy  beyond compare after training as a demon  slayer yorichi could defeat multiple  demons to where his older brother stated  that he as a child couldn't even compare  to him as an adult he alone was able to  corner muzan kibutsuji and overpowered  him in an instant and handed him on the  verge of death until he managed to  escape despite having avoided death  muzen was deeply scarred by that  encounter referring to him as a monster  and even the side of his earrings made  him tremble in shock and the mere  memories of yorichi caused the bodies of  other demons who have never met him to  tremble shortly before his death of at  least 85 years in age he'd battled his  older twin brother kokoshibo who turned  into a demon despite both his old age  and apparent blindness he quickly gained  the upper hand in the battle with a  single move sillating his throat before  he finally died standing up unscathed  kokoshibu himself admits that if yorici  launched a second swing before dying he  would have killed him while commenting  yorichi's power was still in his prime  yorichi's strength is not even  comparable to anyone else in the entire  story he was the first breathing style  user and the only one who got muzan to  his knees therefore he is deserving of  first place on our list click on this  video where we explained all breathing  styles in demon's lair
 

